        "created_at": "2012-11-30T15:57:52.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Question:</p><p>Apostate deals the Hero with the Highest HP H-2 Infernal and H-2 Melee.&nbsp;</p><p>1) Do they count as seperate SOURCES? So Nightmist will only be able to redirect one of the damage, correct?</p><p>2) If the first Hit damages somone so they are no longer the highest HP does the second hit them or the hero who currently has mst HP?</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:36:51.808Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
