        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pwatson1974/{size}/1925_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-11-30T16:03:44.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>In my opinion,</p><p>1) Yes. As they are two different instances and boosted independently, they're different sources of damage. Poor NightMist.</p><p>2) I don't think it changes. It doesn't say \"then hit the target with the highest HP\" so I don't think you change the target. If Fanatic killed a target with the first half of Exorcism, would you let her change target? This works the same way, one target selection, then hit it twice.</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:20:55.922Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
