        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>In my opinion,</p><p>1) Yes. As they are two different instances and boosted independently, they&#39;re different sources of damage. Poor NightMist.</p><p>2) I don&#39;t think it changes. It doesn&#39;t say &quot;then hit the target with the highest HP&quot; so I don&#39;t think you change the target. If Fanatic killed a target with the first half of Exorcism, would you let her change target? This works the same way, one target selection, then hit it twice.</p>",
